SUMMARY:Pearls Before Swine + Pliny The Elder Book & Bottle Signing
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Russian River Brewing Company in Windsor for a special evening with Pearls Before Swine creator Stephan Pastis and RRBC’s Natalie & Vinnie Cilurzo! Celebrate the limited-edition Pliny the Elder collaboration as Stephan signs bottles featuring his artwork\, along with copies of his new book\, Pearls Jubilee.
